#: includes/class-verification-code-handler.php:109
msgid "Too many verification codes requested. Please wait a few more seconds before requesting another code."
msgstr "Sono stati richiesti troppi codici di verifica. Attendi qualche secondo prima di richiedere un altro codice."

#. translators: %d: number of minutes to wait
#: includes/class-verification-code-handler.php:115
